@startuml
title EventEase - State Diagram (Attendance Request)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}

skinparam ArrowColor Black

' These four states ARE the RequestStatus enum in the database:
' PENDING_TEAM_HEAD, PENDING_PRESIDENT, APPROVED, REJECTED.
'
' Note there is no arrow back from Pending President to Pending Team Head.
' Approval only moves forward — the President verifies or rejects outright.
'
' CC credits are deliberately NOT mentioned here. A request is ONE missed
' lecture; credits are per (volunteer, event) and are awarded separately by the
' Team Head after the event. Tying credits to request approval would pay out
' five times for five lectures missed at one event.

state "Pending Team Head" as PendingTH
state "Pending President" as PendingPR
state Approved
state Rejected

[*] --> PendingTH : Request Submitted

PendingTH --> PendingPR : Approved by Team Head
PendingTH --> Rejected : Rejected by Team Head

PendingPR --> Approved : Verified by President
PendingPR --> Rejected : Rejected by President

Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]

note right of Approved
Attendance Updated
Lecture counts on the
class attendance sheet
Teacher can download it
end note

@enduml
